{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "15215ccdf2cbfc2cf319e7d20ade9fa2c96e02146e0d097d866f9ccbeca17974", "ja": "それぞれの", "zh": "各自的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "31b40f446852d27ec22f3954e548cd1bb53a5945f9053702e5e89f5bbc1e09a0", "ja": "Astro歌謡祭で新人賞を獲得した新生I.V.\nは名実共に人気アイドルグループになった。\nクロエは海外進出のため英語を学び始め、\nなるは映画の主演が決まる。真珠星は自分が\nどうしてアイドルになったのか迷い始める。", "zh": "在Astro歌谣祭获得新人奖的新生I.V.，\n名副其实地成为了人气偶像组合。\n克洛伊为了进军海外开始学习英语，\n奈留决定担任电影主演。真珠星则开始对\n自己为何成为偶像而感到迷茫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "453deb7ec1c01115f06c739745791d233bffdc80d65c562d38241eb742b43198", "ja": "（Astro歌謡祭で新人賞を獲得した新生I.V.は、\n名実ともに人気アイドルグループとなった……）", "zh": "（在Astro歌谣祭上获得新人奖的新生I.V.，名副其实地成为了人气偶像组合……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9c6a9d0b2f4766f5dadd237aaab5e3ff4dcb62540097988989f1c811e2adf19d", "ja": "（第六幕ではその活躍が、暁クロエを中心に語られた。\n世間の注目、そしてメンバーの成長……）", "zh": "（第六幕围绕晓克洛伊，讲述了她们的表现。世人的关注，以及成员们的成长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ea6c39940b668419264617299359e547a03720eba1ac394ee4aeeec197074a30", "ja": "（今、それぞれの道が、変わり始めていた）", "zh": "（此刻，每个人的道路都开始发生变化。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "5edb74dd3259041e291c34f976fa013235620ca2b6ddfd3ae72f6173c9cdeabe", "ja": "ふう、なんとか宿題が終わった。\n芸能学校でも、宿題ってあるんだぁ……。", "zh": "呼，作业总算是做完了。\n原来在艺能学校也有作业啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "d788ef987d7b843a065f9255403d83065400baf9afb93798dfefebec65c7d0d8", "ja": "でも、普通の学校よりは少なめなのかな。\nおかげで、レッスンする時間は作れるし……。", "zh": "不过，作业应该比普通学校少一些吧。\n多亏这样，才能挤出时间练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1005_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "512269d41711e64c490f2d1b36266c8a650efbbe59ac4d9e9baa11b4a83f6714", "ja": "お疲れ。\n……今日は、真珠星だけか。", "zh": "辛苦了。  \n……今天只有珍珠星吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "c5f1a282e74e970983154fc0ac4a48ec30a5b29b34d8b593ff7070e468a39b84", "ja": "お疲れさま、クロエさん。\nこれからレッスン？　それなら私も一緒に……。", "zh": "辛苦了，克洛伊。\n接下来要上课吗？那我也一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "3df17c59213d9a60da342925f460c219b729baa244b5308af3779523f49ea6ee", "ja": "いや、今日はレッスンはしない。\n勉強するから、この部屋を使う。いいよな。", "zh": "不，今天不练习。\n我要学习，所以借用这个房间。可以吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8e6bd8263cf20d257d7f22c96984aeccb875286608b18082d636ec085462397", "ja": "えっ！？\nクロエさんが、勉強……！？", "zh": "诶！？\n克洛伊小姐要学习……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "ab4da41f4167f0162cf759868318d9aa4a7908fd48b5c949c1b8db1dd62602f2", "ja": "……なんだ、その反応。\n失礼なやつだな。", "zh": "……你那是什么反应。\n真失礼啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "1b61eb58dd750263c6e09cf6472ef6157108aeb8e682064b294c549b588cfa5c", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい。\nちょっと、意外過ぎて……？", "zh": "对、对不起。\n只是有点太出乎意料了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "58a62af85bbed8394829bc00771de249d56aeb193cfb17e235418c46ee1aaabd", "ja": "苦手だし好きでもないが、必要なんだ。\n英語の勉強。", "zh": "我不擅长，也不喜欢，但这是必要的。学习英语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "4fcb17249eccc63b987c9732e0d0dc44f5302c8ebb59060e8662f61931432ea1", "ja": "英語……。\nもしかして、海外で活動したいとか？", "zh": "英语……难道你是想去海外发展之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "c57aea5d5dfa24c30f954036686fb909719e672674d5aa18ef37124c128bca59", "ja": "今すぐじゃないけどな。ただ、\n日本だけにこだわる理由はないって気が付いた。", "zh": "虽然不是现在马上。不过，我意识到，没必要只局限于日本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "943a82c5dce7d64e4ea34a59fc6d05503675eae9148620e33298eeb41c97edb2", "ja": "……。\nあの。クロエさんは、怖くないの？", "zh": "……\n那个，克洛伊小姐，你不害怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "20aaf814e04e6e683cb48f4826f1f7fb8b7ffc4f46480c84a8b242fedb32c36a", "ja": "怖い？　何が？", "zh": "害怕？怕什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "5633d7025db436b6c3ecd4166244acc42bf0449aa395b1de7a1609c7b3b83d11", "ja": "だって、海外でしょ。\n知らない人ばっかりで、言葉も通じないし……。", "zh": "因为是在国外嘛。\n周围全是陌生人，语言也不通……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "ef5dc1e21014364c35908c98ca417208d7c606d4c04622bcda6716e4e03cdc57", "ja": "だから、今から勉強するんだろ。\nそれに……。", "zh": "所以才要从现在开始学习啊。  \n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "49403bcedf5ab20bc84e29ff4b18c90fc17a576f797de920a5ebf00f186cd98b", "ja": "自分のやりたいことができなかったり、\n夢が叶わないことのほうが、よっぽど怖くないか？", "zh": "比起做不了自己想做的事，或是梦想无法实现，不是后者更加可怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "6d5930e397f7fcde5652afb6d3ea4e5b495b71db6b41abe6a1e495750037a6cb", "ja": "自分の、やりたいこと……。\n夢……。", "zh": "自己想做的事……\n梦想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1021_null", "source_sha256": "903c1b425bacda171af5ab5569c41beb3b93c8235d860d6173f537404a33bb66", "ja": "別の日……", "zh": "另一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "404f5ae663dcf2a819447d42aebc5366170c6250b805de58153135483710f038", "ja": "今日のお仕事は、これでおしまいだね。\n藍さんは撮影に行っちゃったし、帰ろうか？", "zh": "今天的工作就到这里结束了。\n蓝小姐已经去拍摄了，我们回去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "4ddaf4d1c72788729c1d9bc66aec73ae4fce1a29108b62a7f143f7c2218186ad", "ja": "あ、ごめんね。私もこの後、\n打ち合わせが入ってるの。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。我接下来也有个会议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "194d40d2567b0fc3b6349de1cfdc495f1d104f9d15c0c84d6b26271c84b608d5", "ja": "？　打ち合わせなんてあったか？", "zh": "？我怎么不记得还有商谈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "1378d6c41d23e24fe26234e2e412de5136f40973fd8158d680e175dcd05a7749", "ja": "この前クロエさんに話した、映画のです。\n主演が決まったので。", "zh": "是之前和克洛伊小姐说过的那部电影。\n因为主演已经定下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "6ac483c7a5432e75e016018d99c6f2f0844e6f35559424a0812deea0e247acb7", "ja": "えっ……主演！？　映画の！？", "zh": "诶……主演！？电影的主演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "295e6c1a7f8f515dd626a86f9a4156175f580edced5e92724a84b433db91cc53", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ。\nおめでとう。", "zh": "哦……这样啊。\n恭喜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499", "ja": "ありがとうございます。", "zh": "谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "08acaa2e7cf1c2cc16e82d90bd2c8dec776df8d6ef58718e271d69ff90bf06ef", "ja": "……。なるちゃん、\nアイドルやりたいって言ってたのに……いいの？", "zh": "……。成露，\n你明明说过想当偶像的……这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "6ce08228d16a85c56f893541dc7361528df28ae2821457b7924ee83250cbb619", "ja": "うん。私はアイドルだよ。", "zh": "嗯。我就是偶像呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "3583f0b2a4d4174b856c2045e73b7114e91494d9170860442f596c8ad9cf541a", "ja": "だから神宮寺さんと相談して、演技仕事は断ってたの。\n『I.V.』のみんなで出演した学園ドラマくらい。", "zh": "所以我才和神宫寺小姐商量过，拒绝了演戏的工作。\n只有像和《I.V.》的大家一起出演的校园电视剧那种才会接。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "d39d634df8949615fab88e06b43f125fa04d0a781d9937db552818a82c78c378", "ja": "オファーが来ても、内容に納得できるものだけ\n引き受けたかったから。", "zh": "即使有邀约找上门，我也只想接受那些内容让我满意的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "f136025c84fb359c69a7a6c746b59a919fa0689a0a365df45fa3ce4419cb3c2a", "ja": "今回の話は、納得できたってことだろ？\nよかったじゃないか。", "zh": "这次的工作，你是觉得可以接受的吧？\n那不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "886ecb50b082e3d483578303268ca43421325ae1902bfb8220297b252308e549", "ja": "うん。私の、これまでの仕事をちゃんと知って、\n評価した上でのオファー……うれしかったな。", "zh": "嗯。能在真正了解我至今为止的工作、认可我的表现之后向我发出邀请……我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "6c6d40a79cffb695c2d55c3cde9c1470bfb17650aa0bbb8d016db61d40bfb92c", "ja": "もちろん、両親のことも……湊くんも。\n必要な時には、遠慮なく利用させてもらうけど。", "zh": "当然，父母那边……还有凑君那边也是。\n需要的时候，我会毫不客气地请他们帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1036_033sih", "source_sha256": "a3a97bd7dad47ac8a59577775769443e9ca81de6fc09e525a54b4a777d08d73b", "ja": "……。\nいいと思うよ。", "zh": "……。\n我觉得挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "de23f457d040cf2354eb7fe11155b38b87875eb9ac727549024baeb8c4f122d3", "ja": "ふふ、ありがとうございます。\n……でも私、そんなに変わってないんですよ？", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n……不过我其实没怎么变吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1038_014mir", "source_sha256": "32aacc7bf8bfa71a98bd8e1996a95aafcc1beb4ff4be1a790d8e8d9b80d2e877", "ja": "私の価値は、私が一番よく知ってます。\nだから、大丈夫。", "zh": "我的价值，最了解的人就是我自己。所以，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1039_032emi", "source_sha256": "fcee96952a3fa9777be69d65536923d0c897c75eb8d22a8536108434e8c1049a", "ja": "（……。みんな、アイドルとして、\n自分の道を歩み始めてるんだ……）", "zh": "（……大家都已经开始作为偶像，走上属于自己的道路了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1040_032emi", "source_sha256": "88cae20b55288f2d67a848f4a19fdb68be5456345c22aa5d83cf094b64fd454e", "ja": "（あれ……？　それじゃあ、私は……？\nアイドルとしての、私のこの先は……？）", "zh": "（咦……？那这样的话，我呢……？\n作为偶像，我今后的路又会怎样呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_01_1041_032emi", "source_sha256": "2af3540afd05f50b97fdf511a874f2c9363df778adbfb1dfbe5d55ddd1aba162", "ja": "（私は……なんで、\nアイドルやってるんだっけ……）", "zh": "（我……为什么要当偶像来着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
